        : `ΓÜá∩╕Å **MET ALERT: Genuine Convective Storm Front Validated!**\nStation ${selectedStation.name} (${selectedStation.stationId}) exhibits a coupled barometric plunge (${latestPacket?.ratesOfChange.pressRoC} hPa/10min) with a relative humidity surge (${latestPacket?.ratesOfChange.humRoC}%/10min). The Metshield AI discriminator has classified this as an authentic atmospheric front (WMO Flag 2) rather than a sensor defect. Data is approved for NWP assimilation.`;
    } else if (isFault) {
