        : `≡ƒÜ¿ **SENSOR FAULT: Transducer Anomaly Quarantined!**\nStation ${selectedStation.name} shows an unphysical rate-of-change in ${latestPacket?.xaiAttribution.primaryParameter} (${latestPacket?.xaiAttribution.diagnosticNote}). To safeguard NWP forecast models, this packet is quarantined and replacement data has been imputed per WMO Pub No. 8 protocols.`;
    } else {
      initialAnalysis = language === 'hi'
