        : `Greetings! I am the **Metshield AI Meteorological Assistant**. Station ${selectedStation.name} (${selectedStation.stationId}) is operating nominally under WMO-No. 8 physical limits. Ask me anything about sensor telemetry, Zahumensk├╜ step limits, or NWP gating decisions.`;
